      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the derogatory textual message",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'because bitter, ugly lesbian need attention too!' which is the core hateful message of the meme. This text is not visually depicted as belonging to any specific person in the image but is presented as a direct address to the viewer, implying that the user is being asked to consider or accept this degrading stereotype about lesbians. The projection is onto the textual material, which frames the entire protest scene through a lens of prejudice.",
