      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the general public who may hold prejudiced views toward lesbians, particularly those who are unfamiliar with or dismissive of LGBTQ+ communities. The hateful text 'because bitter, ugly lesbian need attention too!' is intended to elicit a reaction from viewers who might find the stereotype offensive or relatable, thereby reinforcing negative perceptions of lesbians. The target audience likely includes individuals who are not part of the feminist or LGBTQ+ communities, or who hold conservative or heteronormative views, as the meme uses derogatory language to attack a specific subgroup within feminism.",
